sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant API as AdminOrderController
    participant Tx as AdminOrderCompletionService
    participant DB as Order PostgreSQL
    participant Relay as AFTER_COMMIT / Outbox dispatcher
    participant PubSub as Existing Pub/Sub topics
    participant Credit as Credit completion subscriber
    participant User as User penalty subscriber (pending)
    Admin->>API: POST /api/orders/admin/{orderId}/complete
    API->>API: RequireAdminRole / validate body
    API->>Tx: Stored participant assertions and selected policies
    Tx->>DB: NOWAIT lock and unresolved-command guard
    alt Exact bound ADMIN_COMPLETE replay
        DB-->>Tx: Existing receipt and Order
        Tx-->>API: Existing result, no new intents
    else New approved resolution
        Tx->>Tx: Validate assigned active state, including hold override
        Tx->>Tx: Highest selected addition or waiver (no auto scoring)
        Tx->>DB: Atomic COMPLETED, admin decision, checkpoint, receipt, completion intent
        opt Admin selected penalty
            Tx->>DB: Same transaction penalty addition intent
        end
        DB-->>Tx: Commit (or rollback every write on failure)
        Tx-->>API: Resulting Order
        DB-->>Relay: After-commit dispatch signal
        Relay->>PubSub: Publish stable event ID; recover failed publication
        PubSub->>Credit: Existing OrderCompletionTaskEvent
        Credit->>Credit: Deduplicate, validate reservation/courier/amount, transfer atomically
        opt Selected penalty only
            PubSub-->>User: Existing PenaltyScoreAdditionEvent
        end
    end
    API-->>Admin: 200 OrderResponse; subscriber processing is asynchronous
